hi everyone  my name is anushari vastava and i'm  excited to talk to you today about the  new  cloud document ai platform let's dive in  to learn more  document ai is google's solution for  understanding documents in what  we consider dark formats such as pdfs  handwritten forms and images using the  power of ai  document ai turns these unstructured  documents into structured  actionable data for example  you could process multi-page handwritten  applications with a form parser  there are also several specialized  parsers  already created so you could be batch  processing tax documents by this  afternoon  with structured data you can fuel better  business decisions  ensure that your data is accurate and  compliant  and use your data to meet customer  expectations  or hey maybe you're just sitting on a  pile of crumpled receipts you want to  digitize  it's easy to get started with our  specialized parsers  or bring your own document type and test  out our form parser  it's all in the new document ai platform  let's take a look  the platform available in the google  cloud console  is where you can create modify and test  out your processors  we'll walk through an example on the  platform and talk about what's going on  under the hood to show you what makes  document ai special  today we'll demo how to parse a driver's  license application  and show you how to integrate it into  your app or service  here is an image of my form you can see  it's been damaged  it's crumpled and just does not have  great image quality  i want to test out what the generic form  parser will be able to extract  so i will create an instance of it here  i intend to use it in my application's  code on more documents  so these variables up here will be  important later let's test it out  you can see the key value pairs  extracted they're now in a digital  format  easy to use so what happens  under the hood when you run a document  through a processor  first doc prep scans cleans and extracts  text from the image  using google ocr which supports over 150  languages  next the word text and visual elements  are used for classification when  required  google uses an ensemble of natural  language models to extract  simple and compound entities  when the entities are related they're  grouped together  last but not least your document is  packaged up in a unified document format  and sent back to you now that we  understand what's going on  let's integrate my processor into my  application  i'm showing some python code today but  we have client  libraries available in several languages  this api is incredibly simple for how  much is happening behind the scenes  all i need is the name of my processor  which i can construct with the variables  from the console  and then just the bytes of the document  or the image  voila now i can expect all the spatial  and text data  back in an easy to use json format  also with all of these key value pairs  it's easy to integrate this data and  other services  storage or visualization tools i might  be using  we're excited to see what you can do  with the power of document ai  get started today and let us know what  use cases you're solving  [Music]

